# .gitignore

# Secrets
envs/**/.secrets
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/firebase-service-account*.json
# GCP console downloads service-account keys as <project>-<hash>.json, with no
# "firebase-adminsdk"/"service-account" substring to match on. Block by the
# project-id-prefixed naming convention anywhere in the tree, not just at repo
# root (2026-07-23 incident: tchalanet-2805cdfeb410.json landed one directory
# deeper the second time, in tchalanet-server/, and wasn't caught).
/*.json
!/.mcp.json
**/tchalanet-[0-9a-f][0-9a-f]*.json
# Signing material and private-key stores — never commit.
# (Public truststores like *-truststore.jks are intentionally tracked.)
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
**/upload-keystore.jks
**/release-keystore.jks
**/key.properties
**/*.env.local

